      "title": "Generated-looking source follows explicit mutation policy",
      "classification": "enforced",
      "actor": "Roslyn Workbench transaction pipeline",
      "outcome": "Generated-looking checked-in source produces a bounded warning or is denied according to startup policy and reviewed path exceptions.",
      "boundary": "Classification applies to source paths selected for supported transaction mutations.",
      "residualRisk": "Path and source heuristics cannot identify every generated file; maintainers remain responsible for repository-specific exceptions and review.",
